0..62 Comment "//! `rules-join` refuses an incomplete join of included rules."
63..66 Comment "//!"
67..146 Comment "//! Each include adds rules to one completed block. `Swapped` leaves a critical"
147..219 Comment "//! pair with incomparable normal forms. With the included rule `first`,"
220..297 Comment "//! `pick (one ()) y` reads `plus (one ()) y` and `plus y (one ())`. The path"
298..368 Comment "//! order orients neither call. The checker refuses the block by name."
369..372 Comment "//!"
373..388 Comment "//! - see: #738"
